## Installation

```
$ gem install <%= gem.name %>
```

## Quick Start

```ruby
require "<%= gem.entrypoint_require %>"
<%- service = gem.quick_start_service -%>
<%- method = service&.quick_start_method -%>
<%- if service && method -%>

client = <%= service.create_client_call %>
request = <%= method.request_type %>.new # (request fields as keyword arguments...)
response = client.<%= method.name %> request
<%- end -%>
```

## Supported Ruby Versions

This library is supported on Ruby 3.2+.

Google provides official support for Ruby versions as described in the
[Supported Ruby versions](https://docs.cloud.google.com/ruby/getting-started/supported-ruby-versions)
policy. Older versions of Ruby _may_ still work, but are unsupported and not
recommended.
